flowchart TD
    A[Face touch / reaching toward face] --> B[Block hand gently]
    B --> C[Calm rule: Hands down / Do not touch face]
    C --> D[Show safe replacement]
    D --> D1[High five / wave / shoulder touch / hands in lap]
    D1 --> E{Safe hands?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Adult: Nice hands down]
    E -- No --> G[Adult steps back 5 to 10 seconds]
    G --> H[Return calmly with low attention]
    H --> C
    F --> I[Continue activity]
    I --> J[Track safe-hands win]
